  Total time: 29s

  The ledger is still running, and you are on it.
    xrpl-camp read                     your entries, read back off the ledger
    xrpl-camp read <address>           what somebody else wrote — no key needed
    xrpl-camp try                      make it fail on purpose. Costs nothing.

  Check your proof pack any time: xrpl-camp proof verify xrpl_camp_proof_pack.json

